  "question_count": 1,
  "is_atomic": true,
  "atomic_questions": [
    "When you say \"maximize total revenue,\" do you mean (A) maximize total sales revenue only (sum of sell price × units sold, ignoring purchase costs), (B) maximize net profit (sales revenue minus purchase costs), or (C) maximize net profit where any units still in the warehouse at the end of December also count as value at some price?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response presents a single multiple-choice question asking the user to select one specific definition for the objective function. Although it lists three options, it requires a single policy choice, making it one semantically independent question."
}

